WEBVTT

00:00:00.285 --> 00:00:04.462
You've reviewed a known readiness finding
and the team needs a week to fix it.

00:00:04.632 --> 00:00:09.389
Use a time-limited acceptance to record
that decision and see what changes.

00:00:09.952 --> 00:00:12.652
Open the report's Readiness tab, choose the

00:00:12.652 --> 00:00:15.540
family, and select Accept on that one
finding.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.923
Check the scope in the dialog before you
choose an end date.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:24.534
For this example, choose an end date one
week out, within the test config's policy.

00:00:24.705 --> 00:00:29.037
Add a reason that explains the exception,
and confirm who owns the fix.

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:31.172
Check whether it applies across builds.

00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:34.593
Read What changes to see the effect on the
family.

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:37.822
The existing report keeps the verdict it
already had.

00:00:37.993 --> 00:00:40.654
Confirm once you've reviewed the proposed
change.

00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:45.485
Run a fresh replay to get a new verdict
with the acceptance in effect.

00:00:45.656 --> 00:00:50.448
Use the Acceptances in effect ledger to
check when it expires, or reopen the

00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:52.339
finding once the fix is ready.

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:57.294
If the next replay still says Not ready,
look for the family that's still blocking.
